---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftRepairSymptom
---
Construct a RepairSymptom draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Read the request and prior attempts to separate observations from the requester’s diagnosis. Identify approved handling restrictions and information needed for safe routing, without inventing technical causes or giving unqualified hazardous repair instructions.
